{"reference":"Jeremiah 26","book":"Jeremiah","chapter":26,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"A precedent in the hearing","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"In the dispute over Jeremiah’s message, the elders appeal to Micah of Moresheth, whom the chapter identifies as a prophet in Hezekiah’s days. They cite Micah’s warning that Zion and Jerusalem would be devastated, then recall that Hezekiah and Judah did not put him to death. The appeal presents an earlier prophetic warning as a precedent within the debate over Jeremiah’s fate.","verse_refs":["Jeremiah 26:18-19"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_026_6890a4c87b06b30e129fd2dc"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]},{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"The book’s varied forms","blocks":[{"id":"block_2","text":"The received book of Jeremiah brings together poetry, prose sermons, narratives, letters, headings, repeated accounts, restoration collections, oracles concerning nations, and an appendix. Its broad arrangement is often outlined as chapters 1; 2–25; 26–29; 30–33; 34–45; 46–51; and 52, though that outline does not settle how the book took shape.","verse_refs":["Jeremiah 10:1-25","Jeremiah 11:1-23","Jeremiah 12:1-17","Jeremiah 13:1-27","Jeremiah 14:1-22","Jeremiah 15:1-21","Jeremiah 16:1-21","Jeremiah 17:1-27","Jeremiah 18:1-23","Jeremiah 19:1-15","Jeremiah 1:1-19","Jeremiah 20:1-18","Jeremiah 21:1-14","Jeremiah 22:1-30","Jeremiah 23:1-40","Jeremiah 24:1-10","Jeremiah 25:1-38","Jeremiah 27:1-22","Jeremiah 28:1-17","Jeremiah 29:1-32","Jeremiah 2:1-37","Jeremiah 30:1-24","Jeremiah 31:1-40","Jeremiah 32:1-44","Jeremiah 33:1-26","Jeremiah 34:1-22","Jeremiah 35:1-19","Jeremiah 36:1-32","Jeremiah 37:1-21","Jeremiah 38:1-28","Jeremiah 39:1-18","Jeremiah 3:1-25","Jeremiah 40:1-16","Jeremiah 41:1-18","Jeremiah 42:1-22","Jeremiah 43:1-13","Jeremiah 44:1-30","Jeremiah 45:1-5","Jeremiah 46:1-28","Jeremiah 47:1-7","Jeremiah 48:1-47","Jeremiah 49:1-39","Jeremiah 4:1-31","Jeremiah 50:1-46","Jeremiah 51:1-64","Jeremiah 52:1-34","Jeremiah 5:1-31","Jeremiah 6:1-30","Jeremiah 7:1-34","Jeremiah 8:1-22","Jeremiah 9:1-26"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_026_e728ab454f9a068eac56f641"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}